{"data":{"ExtRef_Child_hu_note":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"（壬子、一一二）","note_content_jianti_auto":"（壬子、一一二）","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95d9a516-db0e-11ef-a1c2-a0d3651f611f"},"ExtRef_Children_contents":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂爲土室蓄火，使土氣蒸鬱而養之，強使成熟也。前書·召信臣傳曰：太官園種冬生葱韭菜茹，覆以屋廡，晝夜然蘊火，待溫氣乃生。強，其兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓为土室蓄火，使土气蒸郁而养之，强使成熟也。前书·召信臣传曰：太官园种冬生葱韭菜茹，覆以屋庑，昼夜然蕴火，待温气乃生。强，其两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"95d9a518-db0e-11ef-8be7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"夭，於兆翻；短折曰夭。長，知兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"夭，于兆翻；短折曰夭。长，知两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"95d9a51a-db0e-11ef-b7f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95d9a51c-db0e-11ef-8865-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"召信臣","people_name_jianti_auto":"召信臣","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"95d9a51d-db0e-11ef-8509-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：論語曰：不時不食。言非其時物，則不食之。前書，召信臣曰：不時之物，有傷於人，不宜以奉供養。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：论语曰：不时不食。言非其时物，则不食之。前书，召信臣曰：不时之物，有伤于人，不宜以奉供养。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"95d9a51b-db0e-11ef-ae58-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"時熟乃上進也。上，時掌翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"时熟乃上进也。上，时掌翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"95d9a520-db0e-11ef-b64b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1春，正月，甲寅，詔曰：「凡供薦新味，多非其節，或鬱養強孰，或穿掘萌芽，味無所至而夭折生長，豈所以順時育物乎！傳曰：『非其時不食。』自今當奉祠陵廟及給御者，皆須時乃上。」凡所省二十三種。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月甲寅日，下诏说：“各地进献的新鲜食物，大多不合时令；有的在温室中培育，强行催熟；有的在刚萌芽时就被从土中挖出，滋味还未长成，却已使生长夭折，这哪里是顺应天时、养育万物呢！《论语》上说：‘不合时令的食物不吃。’从今以后，凡是供奉陵园宗庙以及供给御用的食物，都必须合于时令才能进献。”总共减省了二十三种。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，甲寅，诏曰：「凡供荐新味，多非其节，或郁养强孰，或穿掘萌芽，味无所至而夭折生长，岂所以顺时育物乎！传曰：『非其时不食。』自今当奉祠陵庙及给御者，皆须时乃上。」凡所省二十三种。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4036,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"95d9a517-db0e-11ef-9911-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2三月，十州蝗。","content_fanyi":"三月，十个州发生了蝗灾。","content_jianti_auto":"2三月，十州蝗。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4037,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian